[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 543.35, "timestamp": "00:09:03", "text": "呃，哦，我把它關了嗎？不在那裡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 545.509, "timestamp": "00:09:05", "text": "Twitch、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 548.79, "timestamp": "00:09:08", "text": "Kick 和 YouTube 上都會置頂訊息。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 552.79, "timestamp": "00:09:12", "text": "嗯，這很重要，因為在上一流（"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 554.55, "timestamp": "00:09:14", "text": "不是上一幀流），也就是幾流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 557.43, "timestamp": "00:09:17", "text": "之前，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 576.389, "timestamp": "00:09:36", "text": "YouTube為什麼改變了介面顏色？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 583.35, "timestamp": "00:09:43", "text": "我當時是不是在找一款第一人稱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 586.389, "timestamp": "00:09:46", "text": "射擊遊戲之類的東西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 589.67, "timestamp": "00:09:49", "text": "呃，因為我沒有像《戰地》"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 593.35, "timestamp": "00:09:53", "text": "或《決勝時刻》之類的遊戲，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 597.269, "timestamp": "00:09:57", "text": "呃，《決勝時刻》……呃，它製作了一些付費"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 599.67, "timestamp": "00:09:59", "text": "版本的《決勝時刻》之類的東西。  要"}]